<span data-as=3D"p">A thread=E2=80=99s current and historical state can be =
retrieved. To persist state, a thread must be created prior to executing a =
run. The LangSmith API provides several endpoints for creating and managing=
 threads and thread state. See the <a href=3D"https://langchain-ai.github.i=
o/langgraph/cloud/reference/api/" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noreferrer" clas=
s=3D"link">API reference</a> for more details.</span>
