4H184c-13.3 0-24-10.7-24-24s10.7-24 24-24z"></path></svg></div></a></div><s=
pan class=3D"cursor-pointer"><code>config</code></span></h4>
<span data-as=3D"p">The config should contain <code>thread_id</code> specif=
ying which thread to update. When only the <code>thread_id</code> is passed=
, we update (or fork) the current state. Optionally, if we include <code>ch=
eckpoint_id</code> field, then we fork that selected checkpoint.</span>
<h4 class=3D"flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id=3D"values"><d=
iv class=3D"absolute" tabindex=3D"-1"><a href=3D"https://docs.langchain.com=
