></path></svg></div></a></div><span class=3D"cursor-pointer">Checkpointer l=
ibraries</span></h2>
<span data-as=3D"p">Under the hood, checkpointing is powered by checkpointe=
r objects that conform to <a href=3D"https://reference.langchain.com/python=
/langgraph/checkpoints/#langgraph.checkpoint.base.BaseCheckpointSaver" targ=
et=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link"><code>BaseCheckpointSaver</=
code></a> interface. LangGraph provides several checkpointer implementation=
s, all implemented via standalone, installable libraries:</span>
<ul>
<li><code>langgraph-checkpoint</code>: The base interface for checkpointer =
savers (<a href=3D"https://reference.langchain.com/python/langgraph/checkpo=
ints/#langgraph.checkpoint.base.BaseCheckpointSaver" target=3D"_blank" rel=
=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link"><code>BaseCheckpointSaver</code></a>) and se=
rialization/deserialization interface (<a href=3D"https://reference.langcha=
in.com/python/langgraph/checkpoints/#langgraph.checkpoint.serde.base.Serial=
izerProtocol" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link"><code>Ser=
ializerProtocol</code></a>). Includes in-memory checkpointer implementation=
 (<a href=3D"https://reference.langchain.com/python/langgraph/checkpoints/#=
langgraph.checkpoint.memory.InMemorySaver" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"norefer=
rer" class=3D"link"><code>InMemorySaver</code></a>) for experimentation. La=
ngGraph comes with <code>langgraph-checkpoint</code> included.</li>
<li><code>langgraph-checkpoint-sqlite</code>: An implementation of LangGrap=
h checkpointer that uses SQLite database (<a href=3D"https://reference.lang=
chain.com/python/langgraph/checkpoints/#langgraph.checkpoint.sqlite.SqliteS=
aver" target=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link"><code>SqliteSaver=
</code></a> / <a href=3D"https://reference.langchain.com/python/langgraph/c=
heckpoints/#langgraph.checkpoint.sqlite.aio.AsyncSqliteSaver" target=3D"_bl=
ank" rel=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link"><code>AsyncSqliteSaver</code></a>). =
Ideal for experimentation and local workflows. Needs to be installed separa=
tely.</li>
<li><code>langgraph-checkpoint-postgres</code>: An advanced checkpointer th=
at uses Postgres database (<a href=3D"https://reference.langchain.com/pytho=
n/langgraph/checkpoints/#langgraph.checkpoint.postgres.PostgresSaver" targe=
t=3D"_blank" rel=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link"><code>PostgresSaver</code></=
a> / <a href=3D"https://reference.langchain.com/python/langgraph/checkpoint=
s/#langgraph.checkpoint.postgres.aio.AsyncPostgresSaver" target=3D"_blank" =
rel=3D"noreferrer" class=3D"link"><code>AsyncPostgresSaver</code></a>), use=
d in LangSmith. Ideal for using in production. Needs to be installed separa=
tely.</li>
</ul>
<h3 class=3D"flex whitespace-pre-wrap group font-semibold" id=3D"checkpoint=
er-interface"><div class=3D"absolute" tabindex=3D"-1"><a href=3D"https://do=
