/svg" fill=3D"gray" height=3D"12px" viewBox=3D"0 0 576 512"><path d=3D"M0 2=
56C0 167.6 71.6 96 160 96h72c13.3 0 24 10.7 24 24s-10.7 24-24 24H160C98.1 1=
